<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-10-24T16:46:07.227Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 16:46:07 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Burkina Faso junta has reinstated the death penalty for terrorism, treason and high crimes, while its army and Russian mercenaries face fresh accusations of civilian killings. In Nigeria, 600 soldiers are being sent to India for specialised training and militants killed 14 security personnel in an attack on a base. In Niger, two European women were freed after more than a year of captivity and gunmen attacked buses in the north, killing at least twelve people. Mali’s army and Russian fighters are again accused of new civilian abuses. The conflict produced 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxQcENnbnZtdVJ2MlgxX1ZZckZLZVZnd1JkdC11RnFDdllKNnhuTjBmai1QNFA3T3A1Z3J1M3lVLWxVZHp0NnAtM1UzUVVHOVl5YWtOV19DS3phdXZLclB0ODZ3ME5mNk1KOXNYMU4yNEctR3FVTmQtcU42S0ZpdUtKb0xGVU9ZWWVQdVdSWnNUMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTFA4eFFtbFV4MUhtcS1TWld0bGdkWFlKY2pZU3U2cUgyTENPNFg2QnFHVUE1YW5FQi1WWW02RUY5WmNBejF0ZXl4dXJMaWw5aU9ZUzBEcHJHTTZ3VVdjcXpqSjYzZ9IBY0FVX3lxTFA4eFFtbFV4MUhtcS1TWld0bGdkWFlKY2pZU3U2cUgyTENPNFg2QnFHVUE1YW5FQi1WWW02RUY5WmNBejF0ZXl4dXJMaWw5aU9ZUzBEcHJHTTZ3VVdjcXpqSjYzZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE1fT3Y1SmgzVkgwcldVSEE4TVhadm1LeXhkeW1hclBrMFNyQ0JPYXZhOWc5ZGNVTHVwRE9kcFRXa1d2d283YkdHZFhEVW02UHhkWThWclY4eVlpUjg?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOOUVqNllZMWlndnZmX3dxamhYM25iZ3FIemFyRy1sbFB0cHhkY2RfQkpkaldkWHA0ZVFEclJpRnZGeXVlNXp5Tnh5RjRiTGRQeGN1eUlhNXM5RWNCRmpwRWRUQldHX25PWjVES2xmREpaaW5vQUZlZmFybldfV1JNQU1OdUpzOFVHN1NhX2xDeDNxOEpBSGUyel9MbDBNUkpKc3l3TnNqNkh3NjVZLTh4UnlvTVFycjNp?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria 